.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.env
*.pem
*.key
credentials*.json

# Claude Code writes runtime state into ~/.claude (symlinked here).
# Ignore everything under the package, then whitelist tracked configs.
claude/.claude/*
!claude/.claude/settings.json
!claude/.claude/commands/
!claude/.claude/hooks/
!claude/.claude/skills/
!claude/.claude/AGENTS.md
!claude/.claude/CLAUDE.md

# Codex writes far more runtime state into ~/.codex than Claude does into
# ~/.claude (sessions/, three SQLite DBs + WAL sidecars, logs, caches, plugins).
# Same treatment: ignore the package, whitelist only what's tracked.
# AGENTS.md here is a symlink to claude/.claude/AGENTS.md -- ONE canonical global
# instruction file, two harnesses. Don't replace it with a copy.
codex/.codex/*
!codex/.codex/AGENTS.md
